ent has just called the blind (limped). Since you will be acting first in the betting rounds after the flop (out of position), checking is a solid, low-variance play that lets you see community cards without investing more chips. It avoids getting re-raised and keeps the opponent's range wide, which your hand plays well against.\n\nAnswer: 0"}
