nent only called, you have the option to "Check" and see the flop for free. Raising would inflate the pot with a marginal hand while out of position, and folding is irrational when you can proceed without spending more chips. Checking is the most prudent action to realize your hand\'s equity.\n\nAnswer: 0'}
